
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Kiem tra API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach san pham
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### 3. Lay san pham ID 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### 4. Lay san pham khong ton tai
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999

### 5. Tao san pham moi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
    "description": "Tai lieu hoc gRPC",
    "price": 180000
}

### 6. Tao san pham sai
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "description": "Test",
    "price": 0
}
